# a setup saved by 1.0.4 / 1.0.5 (format 2) loads: the instrument keeps its name through both renumberings (1.0.6 put
# Kokyu before Taiko; 1.0.8 grouped the families: Bamboo Flt 5 is now 11, Taiko 6 is now 18), Trill feel takes its new
# default, the trill's defaults appear
store_v2 5
reboot
wait 100
expect par7 11
store_v2 6
reboot
wait 100
expect par7 18
expect par15 100
expect par44 42
expect par48 0
# what this version saves loads as it is
spin PRESET -1
tap SAVE
wait 50
reboot
wait 100
expect par7 17
# a setup saved by 1.0.6 / 1.0.7 (format 3) loads in 1.0.8: the instrument keeps its name although the twenty-one
# are now in the strip's families (Taiko 7 becomes 18, Koto Pluck 10 becomes 2, Koto 0 stays 0)
store_v3 7
reboot
wait 100
expect par7 18
store_v3 10
reboot
wait 100
expect par7 2
store_v3 0
reboot
wait 100
expect par7 0
